#: ../../../gpu-safety/verified-kernels.md:34
msgid ""
"We do not prove functional correctness or floating-point math formulas. "
"Instead, we prove the exact memory and concurrency rules needed to make the "
"kernel safe and strip out redundant bounds checks:"
msgstr ""

